65
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:53,920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: RDC, or the Regional Development Council,

66
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:56,920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: supported with resolutions.

67
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Signed Certificate of Implementability.

68
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:05,920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Every project will be monitored via DBM Compass

69
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:09,920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and the DPWH Transparency Portal

70
