Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dati TIKAS, ngayon po ay nasa BIP na.

1544
02:00:12,340 --> 02:00:20,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po bang magbigay ng paliwanag ang ating sponsor hinggil sa mga proyektong ito?

1545
02:00:20,600 --> 02:00:26,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bakit po sa kabila ng hindi pa tapos, meron na agad mga bagong allocation para sa 2027?

1546
02:00:26,880 --> 02:00:33,440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor. May mga project talaga na hindi pa tapos.

1547
02:00:33,940 --> 02:00:44,240
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Katulad halimbawa ng sinasabing multi-purpose building ng San Antonio Zambales, hindi pa siya tapos dahil hindi siya fully funded.

1548
02:00:44,240 --> 02:00:56,740
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In fact, that's the reason why in 2027 budget, sinama nila sa BIP ang amount na 10 million to complete the project.

1549
02:00:56,880 --> 02:01:05,200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: But ang dahilan ng mga hindi na tapos, dahil kulang din ng pundo para tapusin ang proyekto na yan.

1550
02:01:05,900 --> 02:01:14,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang concern natin dito ginoong speaker, hindi po kasi dito nakalagay kung anong percentage ng completion.

1551
02:01:14,640 --> 02:01:17,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakalagay po dito 0% accomplishment.

1552
02:01:17,580 --> 02:01:26,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So ibig sabihin, kung meron mang nauna na nalagak na pondo, hindi po reflected doon sa website, sa ating transparency portal,

1553
02:01:26,880 --> 02:01:40,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung meron nang natapos, hindi din po nakalagay dito ng malinaw, multi-phase ba itong proyekto, nasa na ba tayo, phase 1, phase 2, phase 3, hanggang kailan po ito, kailan ba matatapos yung mga proyekto.

1554
02:01:41,100 --> 02:01:48,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So kapag ganito po yung kalagayan, napakahirap po natanggapin na meron na namang bago na allocation para sa susunod na taon.

1555
02:01:49,440 --> 02:01:56,580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, ang sinabi ng Department of Public Works and Highways,

1556
02:01:56,880 --> 02:02:01,220
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: yung transparency portal, hindi pa nila na-update, no?

1557
02:02:01,220 --> 02:02:15,620
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: However, they will be submitting to the Honorable Interpolator the exact figure as well as the exact update of the different projects under the TCAS program of the Department of Public Works and Highways.

1558
02:02:16,520 --> 02:02:24,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, aginoong speaker, at aasahan po natin yung pinakahuli na status report sa mga nasabing proyekto.

1559
02:02:24,540 --> 02:02:26,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung meron pa po kayong ulat,

1560
02:02:26,880 --> 02:02:34,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may kinalaman din dun sa iba pang mga continuing projects na patuloy natatanggap ng bagong allocation para sa 2027.

1561
02:02:34,900 --> 02:02:42,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napansin din namin, aginoong speaker, na isa dun sa mga contractor na nakakakuha ng mga proyekto sa ilalim ng TCAS

1562
02:02:42,920 --> 02:02:50,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay ang T2B3 Builders and Supplies Corporation na nakakuha rin ng maraming government infrastructure contracts

1563
02:02:50,160 --> 02:02:53,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kabilang na ang mga flood control projects.

1564
02:02:53,640 --> 02:02:55,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po, ay...

1565
02:02:56,880 --> 02:03:01,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa tigin po namin, hanggat hindi pa natatapos yung investigation,

1566
02:03:01,620 --> 02:03:06,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bakit po natin pinapayagan na magkaroon ng ganitong mga issue?

1567
02:03:06,560 --> 02:03:15,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ba malinaw na red flag na habang ang pareho na contractor ay naiimbestigahan kaugnay ng flood control,

1568
02:03:16,040 --> 02:03:21,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay pinapayagan pa rin po natin yung participation sa ibang mga kontrata ng pamahalaan?

1569
02:03:25,000 --> 02:03:26,560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor,

1570
02:03:26,880 --> 02:03:34,540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: that specific contractor is subject for investigation according to the Secretary

1571
02:03:34,540 --> 02:03:41,180
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and anytime from now, they will submit the result of their investigation

1572
02:03:41,180 --> 02:03:48,980
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: as to the numbers of projects that was under contract with that particular contractor

1573
02:03:48,980 --> 02:03:54,900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: as well as the performance of that particular contractor on each of every project

1574
02:03:54,900 --> 02:03:55,980
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: na napanalunan.

1575
02:03:56,880 --> 02:03:57,900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: nila during the bidding.

1576
02:03:58,800 --> 02:04:04,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, ano po yung timeline natin pagdating sa investigation dito sa program na ito?

1577
02:04:04,720 --> 02:04:07,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kailan po natin maasahan na meron tayong kasagutan?

1578
02:04:24,100 --> 02:04:26,860
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor. The

1579
02:04:26,860 --> 02:04:41,600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: report as to the accomplishment of each project can be submitted. They will submit it next week. However, the result of the investigation hindi ho nila maibigay muna ngayon dahil this is a joint investigation with DPWH, Ombudsman and other agencies of government.

1580
02:04:41,600 --> 02:04:56,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat at patuloy po natin itong susubaybayan at matiyak po natin ang katotohanan at may pananagutan dapat kung meron mang dapat managot. Ngayon naman po, tungkol sa ADB Metro Manila projects na na-raise din po natin sa budget briefing,

1581
02:04:56,840 --> 02:05:03,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede po bang bigyang linaw ng ating Secretary, ng ating Distinguished Sponsor

1582
02:05:03,080 --> 02:05:09,460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang inyo pong statement na ang Bridge 2 ng ADB Metro Manila Bridges Project

1583
02:05:09,460 --> 02:05:13,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay ngayon po ay dumadaan sa restructuring ang loan?

1584
02:05:14,500 --> 02:05:18,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang ibig nyo po bang sabihin yung loan po ang nilire-restructure?

1585
02:05:18,960 --> 02:05:21,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung kung paano natin ito babayaran muli?

1586
02:05:21,800 --> 02:05:26,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O ang ibig nyo po bang sabihin dito ay,

1587
02:05:26,840 --> 02:05:32,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mag-iiba po ba yung daan dahil dun sa mga issues dun sa lugar?

1588
02:05:33,220 --> 02:05:35,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mari po bang maipaliwanag ng ating Distinguished Sponsor?

1589
02:05:41,080 --> 02:05:42,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, dagdag lang po.

1590
02:05:42,720 --> 02:05:44,000
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

1591
02:05:45,000 --> 02:05:49,020
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: The reason why it was restructured because there is one project,

1592
02:05:51,320 --> 02:05:56,280
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Bridge 2 of Homeowners Drive, Bonifacio Bridge,

1593
02:05:56,840 --> 02:06:03,040
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: which was canceled in the original loan agreement.

1594
02:06:03,740 --> 02:06:08,360
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So kaya ito nagiging na-restructure dahil bumaba yung cost.

1595
02:06:09,040 --> 02:06:10,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ah, bumaba lang po yung cost.

1596
02:06:10,340 --> 02:06:15,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So wala po itong kinalaman sa pagbabago ng dadaanan o ng mga maapektuhan po na area at location?

1597
02:06:15,880 --> 02:06:21,240
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Wala po. So cost lang yun dahil may na-cancel na isang bridge project.

1598
02:06:21,720 --> 02:06:25,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat sa paglilinaw, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

1599
02:06:25,980 --> 02:06:31,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon meron pong publicly available na semi-annual report mula sa Lichelle Technologies

1600
02:06:32,640 --> 02:06:35,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol po sa ADB, Metro Manila Bridges Project.

1601
02:06:36,100 --> 02:06:40,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: The report indicates that DPWH commissioned this study.

1602
02:06:41,320 --> 02:06:42,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Is this correct?

1603
02:06:42,840 --> 02:06:44,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And can the sponsor confirm this?

1604
02:06:55,980 --> 02:07:03,900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes, there is. The Department of Public Works proposes for a study of Metro Manila Bridge.

1605
02:07:04,360 --> 02:07:09,200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: However, dalawa na lang na bridge yung naisama dahil na-cancel nga yung isa.

1606
02:07:09,800 --> 02:07:18,900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yung dalawa ay yung Marcos Highway, St. Mary Avenue Bridge,

1607
02:07:19,900 --> 02:07:22,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and Kabayani and Matandang Balara Bridge.

1608
02:07:23,440 --> 02:07:25,900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yung dalawa na lang po ang understudy ngayon.

1609
02:07:25,980 --> 02:07:29,660
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, in fact, mayroon ng ongoing na nga yung iba.

1610
02:07:30,660 --> 02:07:34,380
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, ito na lang ang naiwan dahil na-cancel nga yung isa.

1611
02:07:36,860 --> 02:07:41,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, kaya po ba may restructuring dahil na-cancel yung isa?

1612
02:07:41,900 --> 02:07:43,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, ibig sabihin na bawas po.

1613
02:07:44,080 --> 02:07:51,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, ibig sabihin po wala na pong bridge to hindi na po talaga tuloy yung dadaan sa homeowners drive at sa Andres Bonifacio Avenue.

1614
02:07:51,480 --> 02:07:54,340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Tama po. Dahil nga na-cancel yung isa, bumaba yung cost.

1615
02:07:55,840 --> 02:07:57,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede po bang malaman kung bakit na-cancel?

1616
02:07:58,940 --> 02:07:59,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po yung dahilan?

1617
02:08:00,220 --> 02:08:03,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Marami pong nagbabantay dito ginoong speaker kasi po...

1618
02:08:03,280 --> 02:08:09,400
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, the main problem is the right of way.

1619
02:08:10,160 --> 02:08:10,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Right of way.

1620
02:08:11,920 --> 02:08:20,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright. Maraming salamat po dun sa confirmation doon sa study at no report ng Lichelle Technologies.

1621
02:08:20,940 --> 02:08:25,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sila po yung nagsabi sa kanilang ulat na meron po...

1622
02:08:25,620 --> 02:08:28,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para dun sa Bridge 1 at Bridge 3.

1623
02:08:28,580 --> 02:08:33,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa Bridge 1, meron pong estimated 514 trees to be cut.

1624
02:08:34,360 --> 02:08:38,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa Bridge 3 naman po, may 350 trees to be cut.

1625
02:08:39,580 --> 02:08:47,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po, ang pinakahuling update ng DPWH, kasi nagkaroon din po ng malakas na kampanya ang mga residente sa Marikina,

1626
02:08:47,180 --> 02:08:51,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na huwag po tuloy ng mga puno, na iligtas ang mga puno.

1627
02:08:52,040 --> 02:08:55,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang pinakahuli daw po na update ng DPWH ay,

1628
02:08:55,620 --> 02:08:59,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula doon sa 20 affected trees para sa Bridge 1,

1629
02:09:01,160 --> 02:09:05,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nakatanggap po sila ng information na walong mature trees na lang

1630
02:09:05,420 --> 02:09:11,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa loob ng Provident Villages ang sasa ilalim sa Earth Bolling.

1631
02:09:11,480 --> 02:09:13,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tama po ba yung information na ito?

1632
02:09:14,500 --> 02:09:17,540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Well, actually, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor,

1633
02:09:18,360 --> 02:09:21,640
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: there was an agreement reached by the Homeowners Association

1634
02:09:22,540 --> 02:09:24,640
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: with regards to the trees in...

1635
02:09:25,620 --> 02:09:26,040
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: ...in the area.

1636
02:09:27,400 --> 02:09:31,980
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: We already approved, or the Homeowners Association approves,

1637
02:09:32,520 --> 02:09:36,100
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: that the 8 affected trees in the area,

1638
02:09:36,640 --> 02:09:38,360
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: may Earth Boll na lang yan.

1639
02:09:38,700 --> 02:09:41,460
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: May Earth Bolling na gagawin, ilipat na lang sa ibang lugar.

1640
02:09:42,100 --> 02:09:42,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker,

1641
02:09:43,900 --> 02:09:47,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi pong representasyon na ito ng kopya nung agreement na yan

1642
02:09:47,000 --> 02:09:51,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa pagitan ng DPWH at ng Homeowners Association,

1643
02:09:52,160 --> 02:09:53,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng tulad po ng sabi ninyo,

1644
02:09:53,420 --> 02:09:55,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nakapag-apply na po ba kayo sa DNR?

1645
02:09:55,620 --> 02:09:57,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang permit for Earth Bolling?

1646
02:09:57,100 --> 02:09:59,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang tanong natin dito, Mr. Speaker,

1647
02:09:59,480 --> 02:10:05,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: paano po kaya magiging posible yung Earth Bolling sa deka-dekadang edad na napuno?

1648
02:10:06,040 --> 02:10:09,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sabi po sa mga description ng inyong binalita,

1649
02:10:09,240 --> 02:10:10,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 8 mature trees.

1650
02:10:10,780 --> 02:10:12,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At siyang ayon po sa mga residente doon,

1651
02:10:13,280 --> 02:10:15,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay deka-dekada na po ang edad ng mga ito.

1652
02:10:16,280 --> 02:10:19,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na po bang technology pagdating dyan dito sa Pilipinas?

1653
02:10:19,960 --> 02:10:21,100
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes, meron na yun.

1654
02:10:21,560 --> 02:10:25,340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, kailangan din talaga ng approval ng DNR.

1655
02:10:25,620 --> 02:10:26,200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: DNR.

1656
02:10:26,760 --> 02:10:30,460
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, right now, what the Department of Public Works and Highways is doing is

1657
02:10:30,460 --> 02:10:38,840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: they are now preparing the application for the Earth Bolling of these trees

1658
02:10:38,840 --> 02:10:41,600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: to the Department of Environmental and Natural Resources.

1659
02:10:42,660 --> 02:10:45,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Of course, all of this is subject to DNR approval.

1660
02:10:46,120 --> 02:10:49,080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Subject pa po yan dun sa permit na ibibigay ng DNR.

1661
02:10:49,860 --> 02:10:51,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakapag-apply na po kayo hindi pa?

1662
02:10:51,680 --> 02:10:53,780
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ongoing ho, ang process na lang ang application nila.

1663
02:10:54,200 --> 02:10:55,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ongoing ang process na lang.

1664
02:10:55,620 --> 02:10:59,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang isa pa na usapin dito, Mr. Speaker,

1665
02:10:59,820 --> 02:11:05,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung tungkol daw po sa maaari na traffic congestion doon sa lugar.

1666
02:11:06,260 --> 02:11:10,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita po natin yung traffic impact study ng proyekto.

1667
02:11:10,720 --> 02:11:14,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po sa pagbibigay ng kopya sa representasyon na ito.

1668
02:11:14,000 --> 02:11:19,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang simulations nyo po, batay pa sa taong 2017 at 2021,

1669
02:11:20,440 --> 02:11:23,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi po ba outdated na ang resulta nito?

1670
02:11:23,580 --> 02:11:25,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil po, kung matatandaan natin 2020,

1671
02:11:25,620 --> 02:11:29,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay hindi pa po ganun kalaya yung pagbiyahe,

1672
02:11:30,220 --> 02:11:31,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: paglalakbay ng ating mga kababayan

1673
02:11:32,240 --> 02:11:37,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil nag-i-ease pa rin yung mga restrictions noong COVID-19 pandemic.

1674
02:11:38,480 --> 02:11:42,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ba, hindi na lapat po sa sitwasyon ngayon

1675
02:11:43,280 --> 02:11:47,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung sinagawang impact study ng DPWH tungkol dito?

1676
02:11:49,540 --> 02:11:53,120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Speaker, with regards to traffic congestion,

1677
02:11:53,120 --> 02:11:55,120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: which is a product,

1678
02:11:56,380 --> 02:11:59,180
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: that's the result when the bridges will be constructed.

1679
02:11:59,940 --> 02:12:03,260
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Of course, mayroong simulation na ginawa na nila.

1680
02:12:03,460 --> 02:12:06,880
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And in fact, mayroon silang mga alternative routes.

1681
02:12:07,480 --> 02:12:13,860
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Once this will be started or ongoing,

1682
02:12:14,420 --> 02:12:19,720
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: mayroon silang mga ruta na na-identify na kung saan i-route natin ang traffic.

1683
02:12:19,720 --> 02:12:23,880
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And pangalawa, the reason why na-cancel din natin yung number one,

1684
02:12:24,680 --> 02:12:25,600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: yung unang tulay,

1685
02:12:25,780 --> 02:12:27,580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: yung na-cancel na tulay,

1686
02:12:28,020 --> 02:12:33,200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: dahil ito ay magdudulot ng traffic talaga na mabigat,

1687
02:12:33,600 --> 02:12:38,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: na walang alternative na ruta na pwedeng mapadaan natin ang traffic.

1688
02:12:39,680 --> 02:12:43,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, sinasabi rin po ng mga residente ng Provident Villages

1689
02:12:43,320 --> 02:12:49,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kapag tinuloy ang Bridge 1 connecting St. Mary Avenue sa loob ng Provident

1690
02:12:49,960 --> 02:12:55,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at sa Marcos Highway, lalong magbubuhol-buhol ang traffic sa A. Bonifacio Avenue.

1691
02:12:55,980 --> 02:13:01,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kahit sa loob ng Provident, dadaan yung mga sasakyan mula sa Katipunan,

1692
02:13:01,940 --> 02:13:05,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Marikina Bayan at Riverbanks, doon daw po babagsak.

1693
02:13:05,660 --> 02:13:12,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, kung maaari, kung wala pa po kayong pinakahuling consultation dito sa lugar na ito,

1694
02:13:12,460 --> 02:13:17,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: magkaroon po ulit, pwede po ninyong ma-review ang inyong traffic impact study.

1695
02:13:18,140 --> 02:13:23,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para itong mga concerns na ito, na ngayon po ay napaparating hindi lang po sa aming representasyon,

1696
02:13:23,820 --> 02:13:25,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron din po silang very active.

1697
02:13:25,620 --> 02:13:29,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon na campaign sa kanila pong lugar ay malaman ng DPWH.

1698
02:13:30,260 --> 02:13:38,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil sa ngayon po, malinaw po yung kanilang sinasabi na muka pong hindi lapat doon sa pangangailangan ng lugar

1699
02:13:38,080 --> 02:13:44,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at ng Metro Manila at hindi po sapat yung mga pag-aaral pagdating sa impact sa kalikasan,

1700
02:13:44,400 --> 02:13:46,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa residente, sa traffic doon sa area.

1701
02:13:47,080 --> 02:13:52,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nararapat lang na magkaroon ng dagdag na konsultasyon.

1702
02:13:52,680 --> 02:13:54,740
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes, Your Honor, Mr. Speaker.

1703
