Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Santander-Cebu.

2985
03:23:59,060 --> 03:24:02,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: To Cebulan-Negros Oriental.

2986
03:24:02,060 --> 03:24:05,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Five kilometers lang po ito.

2987
03:24:05,060 --> 03:24:10,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kailangan na natin po ito.

2988
03:24:10,060 --> 03:24:13,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Pag na-interconnect natin ang major islands

2989
03:24:13,060 --> 03:24:15,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: of Luzon,

2990
03:24:15,060 --> 03:24:16,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Visayas,

2991
03:24:16,060 --> 03:24:17,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: and Mindanao,

2992
03:24:17,060 --> 03:24:18,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Speaker,

2993
03:24:18,060 --> 03:24:23,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang mga panaginip ng ating tao

