Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maigiging irrelevant ang distansya

3001
03:24:43,060 --> 03:24:46,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at pag nagawa po natin ito,

3002
03:24:46,060 --> 03:24:47,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Speaker,

3003
03:24:47,060 --> 03:24:50,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na pwede nating gawin ngayon

3004
03:24:50,060 --> 03:24:53,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na may liderato tayo ng DPWH

