03:26:39,060 --> 03:26:41,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: 1.1 billion.

3048
03:26:41,060 --> 03:26:44,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Para sa feasibility study,

3049
